---
const educationItems = [
  "Cornerstone International Community College of Canada – Web Development Co-op Diploma (2025-2026)",
  "Universidade Vale do Paraiba – Bachelor in Civil Engineering (2011-2016)",
  "Auburn University – Scholarship Program (2014-2015)",
];
---

<section
  id="about"
  data-scroll-reveal="enter bottom move 0px over 0.4s after 0.3s"
>
  <h2 class="section__title">About Me</h2>
  <p class="section__subtitle">How I started as a developer</p>

  <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 mb-10">
    <img
      class="max-w-[270px] md:flex-1/3 h-auto self-center md:self-start"
      src="./images/about.png"
      alt="Image about me"
      loading="lazy"
    />

    <div class="flex-2/3">
      <p>
        <strong class="text-gray-950 dark:text-white">Hi there!</strong><br />
        My name is Maicon, and I am a Senior Full-Stack Developer from Brazil, currently
        living in Vancouver, Canada.<br />
        I originally started my career as a civil engineer, but during one of my
        classes in 2014, I discovered a real passion for coding. By the time I graduated
        in 2016, I had made the decision to transition into software development.<br
        />
        Now, with over six years of experience, I've had the opportunity to work
        on a variety of exciting projects. My expertise spans from developing mobile
        apps with React Native and SwiftUI, building websites using React and Next.js,
        to designing RESTful APIs with Node.js and Golang.<br />
        I began my journey as a freelancer, taking on solo projects under tight deadlines
        and limited budgets. These early challenges pushed me to become a true full-stack
        developer, as I had to handle every aspect of the development process. As
        I gained more experience and expanded my network, I started collaborating
        with medium-sized companies, working in small teams where I focused more
        on scalability and performance.<br />
        For the past three years, I have been working for a large company, contributing
        to big projects within cross-functional teams in structured Agile and Scrum
        environments. This journey has equipped me with the skills to handle projects
        independently as well as thrive in team-driven settings.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h3 class="primary--text text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold mb-1">Education</h3>

  <ul class="secondary--text mb-5">
    {educationItems.map((item) => <li class="list-disc ml-5">{item}</li>)}
  </ul>

  <p>
    Languages: English (Professional), Portuguese (Native), French (Beginner)
  </p>
</section>
